data: {"id": "6bdb7332588d4cbe-thinking-parallel_evidence-1370", "run_id": "6bdb7332588d4cbe", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口如下：\n\n## 1. 关键事实\n- **Pod 身份与生命周期**：Pod `workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` (UID: `7f78dcbf-0a84-437d-b1c1-e376d407c9c0`)，命名空间 `aiops-case-02`，节点 `node2`。创建于 `2026-09-07T07:03:48Z`，未删除。\n- **容器镜像**：`registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，`imagePullPolicy=Always`，无 `imagePullSecrets`。\n- **当前状态**：**Phase 仍为 Pending**，`ContainersNotReady`，容器 `app` 的 `reason` 为 `ImagePullBackOff`，重启次数为 0。\n- **Prometheus 指标**：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}` 在过去 30 分钟内（07:03:48 ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1788766066858, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

