data: {"id": "6bdb7332588d4cbe-final", "run_id": "6bdb7332588d4cbe", "seq": 1375, "ts_ms": 1788766080487, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod配置的镜像仓库registry.invalid不可达（DNS解析失败） |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器状态等待原因: `ImagePullBackOff` (fact-58b65d8300c6) | 明确 Pod 异常终止/启动阶段状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Error: ErrImagePull` (fact-7520f3900de2) | 触发初始镜像拉取失败的直接证据 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 期望拉取镜像: `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` (fact-1ee9dc3c22d1) | 提供故障涉及的镜像及仓库地址，是验证可达性的关键目标 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | DNS解析失败详情: `dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` (fact-1ee9dc3c22d1) | 证实因域名无法解析导致 Docker/Containerd 无法建立网络连接 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}` = 1 (fact-3bcd462ea791) | 从监控维度确认容器当前处于拉取失败的等待状态，与 K8s State 相互印证 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes Event 记录了完整的诊断链条：从触发 `ErrImagePull` 到进入 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态。关键事实 fact-1ee9dc3c22d1 直接提供了底层网络失败的原始报错（DNS 解析失败），直接锁定了镜像地址 `registry.invalid` 无效。Metrics 数据在 fact-3bcd462ea791 中确认了该等待状态仍持续存在。由于容器未启动，Logging 和 Tracing 为空，证据完全基于 K8s 原生状态和监控数据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\n配置了不可用的镜像仓库 registry.invalid (事实3, 4) → DNS解析失败导致网络建立失败 (事实4) → kubelet 拉取镜像被拒绝并触发重试 (事实1, 2) → Pod 进入 ImagePullBackOff 等待状态 (事实5)\n```\n\n**根因结论：**\n已确认根因为 **Pod 配置的镜像仓库不可达（DNS解析失败）**。\n事实 1、2 和 3 证实了镜像拉取失败的直接对象，而事实 4 提供了决定性证据：系统尝试解析 `registry.invalid` 时返回 `no such host`。这导致 kubelet 无法连接该镜像仓库拉取镜像，最终容器维持在 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（事实 1 和 5）。当前证据链完整且无冲突。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 87.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv: 87.2s (Evidence 83.1s, RCA 3.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 113.793, "metrics": {"run_id": "6bdb7332588d4cbe", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 113.80025219917297, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 113800.25219917297, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 77009.39965248108, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 79143.56875419617, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 36370.678663253784}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17118.002891540527, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence"